OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA rather
OL,6,Fcloudy evening but some bright spells
OL,7,Ftoo. A few showers will continue,
OL,8,Fperhaps merging to longer spells of
OL,9,Frain over Skye and the Uists later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FA mostly cloudy day with
OL,12,Foutbreaks of rain. Best chance of dry
OL,13,Fand bright spells will be in the east.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,16,FFurther rain spreading east on Monday
OL,17,Fthen rain or showers on Tuesday and
OL,18,FWednesday. Staying quite cool for the
OL,19,Ftime of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
